# Self-Destruct {1}{R}: "Target creature you control deals X damage to any other target and X damage to itself, where X is its power."
# On turn 1 Black Lotus (RRR) and Mox Pearl pay for Anaba Bodyguard (2/3), Mox Ruby and Mox Jet for Self-Destruct. The first target
# must be a creature Bot1 controls (Bot2, a player, is refused) and the other target cannot be that creature again (CR 115.3);
# Anaba deals X = 2 to Bot2 (20 to 18) and 2 to itself, which it survives with 2 damage marked.

